{"tuid":"o1vxrdu6kmr3sce","pageVersion":20,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2025-05-02"},"identification":{"ifids":["6E0000D4-0BA4-421A-B73F-1A3DFF94C074"],"format":"glulx"},"bibliographic":{"title":"The Origin of Madame Time","author":"Mathbrush","language":"en","firstpublished":"2018-10-01","genre":"Superhero","description":"As an avid fan of superheroes and a harsh critic of villains, the battle over the abandoned amusement park captured your imagination. But when the nuclear airship Mephistopheles exploded above you, it seemed like all was lost--that is, until your latent powers manifested, and you became Madame Time! Explore a frozen world of unbridled power! Use the abilities of hero and villain alike to save the day! <br> <br><i>The Origin of Madame Time</i> is a simple (16K word) inform game set in a single moment of time in a small amusement park. The game is more difficult than my past games, and features less conversation. Madame Time has two hint systems using your powers of Foresight and Aftersight. This game was created in fulfillment of an IFComp 2017 prize."},"contacts":[],"ifdb":{"tuid":"o1vxrdu6kmr3sce","pageversion":20,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=o1vxrdu6kmr3sce","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=o1vxrdu6kmr3sce&version=20"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fglulx%2FThe_Origin_of_Madame_Time.gblorb","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://www.ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/glulx/The_Origin_of_Madame_Time.gblorb","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fglulx%2FThe_Origin_of_Madame_Time.gblorb","title":"Remastered version","desc":"This version has several new and/or changed  puzzles as compared to the original release. ","isGame":true,"format":"blorb/glulx"},{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competitio